[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Harness requirements

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Harness acceptance criteria

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
The first acceptance scenario is: given a checkout-local home and a fixture
provider, when a client submits the same command twice through authenticated MCP,
then one durable job is created, its events are readable, and reopening the host
preserves the result without replaying interrupted external work.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: HARNESS-SCOPE
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Scope
STATEMENT: >>>
The first acceptance scenario is covered through public interfaces without real credentials.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: crates/api/tests/jobs.rs

