[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Gemini / Antigravity account setup on macOS

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: HARNESS-MACOS-SETUP-1
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Vetted macOS runtime installation
STATEMENT: >>>
Given a macOS x64 or arm64 host without Antigravity, when **Settings → Accounts →
Gemini / Antigravity → Find a version to install** is selected, then the runtime
panel offers the vetted Google ACP 1.4.3 archive for that architecture. Review and
install it before selecting **Sign in**. Installation checks the archive's SHA-256
and native ACP initialization before activating it, preserves earlier versions,
and does not start Google OAuth automatically. Windows x64 retains its vetted
1.4.1 release; other platforms can still use explicit runtime paths.
<<<
