[REQUIREMENT]
UID: HARNESS-PR-1
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Pull request tools reuse scoped Jobs and Workspaces
STATEMENT: >>>
The first covers authenticated link authorization/idempotency, the second SQLite
restart/CAS/queue rollback/failure limits, and the third native gh reads, watch
notifications, all three provider approvals/results and head/base staleness.
The gh/provider executables are fixtures in a temporary home; these checks do
not contact a live PR. Shared server/embedded desktop MCP and native bridges
use the same adapter; no new web/desktop/CLI product flow is introduced.
<<<
