[REQUIREMENT]
UID: HARNESS-BROWSER-5
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Bounded browser diagnostics
STATEMENT: >>>
Runtime/Log notifications are reduced to the newest 100 diagnostic entries, with
2000 Unicode characters of text and 512 of URL each; line numbers are one-based.
truncated covers clipped fields and discarded entries. Diagnostics reads neither
clear the sample nor invalidate DOM targets, and never go to host diagnostic
logs. The sample is transient and collected during command processing, not a
durable or complete audit. Detached iframe targets fail closed.
<<<
