mobile screenshot, early console/unhandled exceptions, overflow, isolation and
reset, blocked parent/storage/popups/host requests and speculative connections,
then normal URL browsing. Set GPUI_HTML_EVIDENCE to a path outside the checkout
to retain the HTML screenshot. Native bridge discovery remains shared across
the server/embedded desktop and all three providers; no real login is needed.
<<<

