[REQUIREMENT]
UID: HARNESS-COMPUTER-2
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Execution-bound desktop ownership
STATEMENT: >>>
The first capture claims the desktop for the authenticated durable job and
execution. Another execution or manual command receives a busy error until
the owner closes, completes, cancels, or loses its credential. Captures and
input retain revision, coordinate, scope, native-focus and cancellation checks;
input is never retried automatically. Direct CLI ``ask`` has no durable job and
does not receive computer authority. Native provider support is unchanged.
<<<
