TITLE: Automatic approval of recognized computer tools
STATEMENT: >>>
Scoped read-only MCP sessions may use only the computer capture/act/close tools
under this host policy; other writes still require ``--mcp-write``. Computer tasks
skip ``computer/request_control``. The application automatically accepts recognized
host computer tool permissions and empty host computer confirmations; other
permissions, forms and user questions retain their existing interaction flow.
Unknown provider approval shapes remain interactive rather than broadening
approval to unrelated tools.
