STATEMENT: >>>
``GET /v1/control/computer`` includes additive ``automatic`` (default false for older
hosts). In automatic mode ``expires_in_seconds:0`` means no time-based expiry;
execution validity still controls ownership. Desktop and web display automatic
access instead of a countdown. The following explicit-grant workflow describes
legacy/custom hosts and fixtures that do not opt into automatic control.
