[REQUIREMENT]
UID: HARNESS-COMPUTER-9
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Explicit computer task submission
STATEMENT: >>>
The desktop Codex composer has **Submit computer task** beside the normal send
flow. It submits the same authenticated Jobs request with optional
``computer_use:true`` (default false; omitted for existing callers). Application
pauses such jobs at ``computer/request_control`` before invoking the provider.
The chat's confirmation reuses the job control panel: select **Allow selected job
for 10 minutes…**, confirm the scope, then **Start task**. Start remains disabled
until the host reports a current grant for that exact job. Declining ends the
unstarted job; cancelling or restarting the host never replays it. Direct chat
requests without a durable job reject this flag. The flag is saved intent, not a
grant, and does not authorize native input by itself.
<<<
