UID: HARNESS-COMPUTER-10
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Computer tool approvals and results
STATEMENT: >>>
Native MCP forms with no fields offer one explicit acceptance without asking for
JSON. Other forms retain schema validation and input. Host computer approvals
show in-progress tool arguments alongside the native request; they still reply
to the exact one-use interaction ID. Completed computer tool details show the
returned image and revision/size metadata rather than base64. Text-only or failed
tool results retain their native error details. Normal chat, web/MCP/CLI requests
default to false; provider
wire contracts remain unchanged because the gate runs in application.
<<<
