[REQUIREMENT]
UID: HARNESS-COMPUTER-11
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Approval dialog control actions
STATEMENT: >>>
While a native computer request is pending, its approval dialog also shows the
same host control status, refresh and **Revoke job permission** action. Accepting
capture/input requires a current grant for that exact job and no outstanding
control request. Revocation or an unknown/failed status blocks acceptance;
**Deny** stays available. **Cancel task** cancels the durable job directly
from the dialog and immediately disables the pending approval while cancellation
is outstanding. A failed cancellation restores the interaction controls and
reports the error; it does not claim that the job stopped. Deny rejects one
native request, whereas cancellation stops the whole job. Neither starts input
automatically. An already accepted Windows input batch cannot be undone.
<<<
