- TYPE: File
  VALUE: crates/control/src/lib.rs

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: HARNESS-COMPUTER-12
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Foreground delegation
STATEMENT: >>>
On Windows, the status also includes optional ``foreground`` process identity
(PID and creation time). When a native host request is explicitly accepted for
the granted job, the desktop client uses ``AllowSetForegroundWindow`` for that
exact local process. This lets input restore the clicked editor after the
approval dialog took focus. A remote or reused PID fails identity validation;
no global foreground-lock setting is changed. Older clients can ignore this
additive field; remote-host focus restrictions still apply.
<<<
