The desktop no longer exposes the monitor toolbar button or the standalone
browser/Windows/capture panel. Use the existing job history for execution status, results
and cancellation. AI computer services, native provider adapters, scoped MCP,
automatic approval policy and the HTTP control API are unchanged. Custom hosts
that require explicit grants still use the existing inline chat approval flow.
Computer status is polled only while that inline interaction needs it; opening
ordinary chat tools does not start manual screen-control polling.
<<<
