[REQUIREMENT]
UID: HARNESS-COMPUTER-14
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Explicit operator grant
STATEMENT: >>>
An operator explicitly grants one active job using
``POST /v1/control/computer/grant`` with ``{"job_id":42,"enabled":true}`` and the
existing operator API credential. Use ``enabled:false`` to revoke that job's
grant. Session credentials cannot call this endpoint, and granting is never an
agent MCP tool. Disable manual Windows control first. Only one job can hold the
shared desktop; manual controls and other jobs cannot use it while granted.
``GET /v1/control/computer`` is also operator-only. It returns availability,
manual-control state, ``job_id``, ``execution_bound``, and monotonic
``expires_in_seconds``; expired, revoked and finished-job grants are omitted.
<<<
