[REQUIREMENT]
UID: HARNESS-COMPUTER-15
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Execution-bound grant lifetime
STATEMENT: >>>
The native runtime receives a credential bound to provider/account/workspace,
conversation, durable job, and a fresh execution ID. The first capture attempt
claims the grant for that execution; another execution of the same
job cannot inherit it. Grants last at most ten minutes using a monotonic clock.
Job cancellation/completion, credential expiry/revocation, shutdown, or explicit
close invalidates control. Resuming a conversation or starting a new execution
requires a fresh operator grant. Permissions are in memory, never restored or
replayed after restart.
<<<
