application gate opens in the chat. Grant the task, confirm, and click **Start
task**. Review and accept each native computer action in the same chat; empty
forms need no JSON entry. Inspect the final response and expand the final capture
tool to see the returned image. Do not submit or answer through HTTP during this
UI acceptance. The live runner has no test-only start barrier; ordinary jobs
retain their normal behavior. A job grant and native tool approval are separate
checks. Read-only HTTP inspection may independently verify the UI's result.
