STATEMENT: >>>
``cargo harness client-fixture`` also seeds synthetic AGENTS.md and a
``fixture-verify`` skill with a supporting reference. Use the desktop header’s instruction
status and unified plugin picker, and the separate Instructions/Skills settings, to check selection/removal, persisted enablement,
provider/workspace changes, submit/approve, cancel and reconnect. This is a fixture
acceptance; installed-provider inference and native memory suppression are separate.
<<<
