[REQUIREMENT]
UID: HARNESS-GUIDANCE-3
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Guidance visual acceptance
STATEMENT: >>>
Gate the change with ``cargo harness check --include-desktop``. Visual fixture
acceptance covers web selection/removal, persisted disable/enable across web and
desktop, provider-switch selection reset, Codex submit/approve, cancel while
waiting, and reconnect/reopen of completed and incomplete histories, with no
browser error/warn logs. On desktop, check source/catalog display, selection, and
Claude ``$fixture-verify`` submit/approve with ``Hello 세계`` output. A 640×480
rendered desktop test keeps the long Claude approval and cancel action reachable
by scrolling. Guidance fixtures also cover manifest-link containment, bounded
model diagnostics, EOF frontmatter, and original/changed/removed guidance on all
three transports.
<<<
