[REQUIREMENT]
UID: HARNESS-GUIDANCE-4
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Approval request cancellation fixture
STATEMENT: >>>
``client-fixture`` starts with ``interactive-allow``, which deliberately expects an
allow response. To verify request cancellation, change only its printed temporary
workspace's ``fixture.json`` scenario to the existing ``interactive-request-cancel``
before starting the next conversation. It accepts the cancelled/denied tool
response and continues the native fixture. Cancelling the approval request is
distinct from stopping the entire job. No real login is needed.
<<<
