[REQUIREMENT]
UID: HARNESS-PLUGINS-1
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Grouped plugins and disabled local imports
STATEMENT: >>>
Settings → Plugins groups installed packages, existing standalone skills and
MCP connections. Local imports start disabled and preserve the source folder,
standalone skill bytes/settings and provider/account MCP JSON. See
package format and management (``docs/plugins.md``).
<<<
