[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Workspace security boundaries

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: HARNESS-SECURITY-1
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Operator approval for repository plugins
STATEMENT: >>>
Runtime MCP configuration from a repository plugin requires operator approval stored outside the workspace and bound to its workspace and MCP configuration. A changed configuration requires fresh approval. Automatic imports may enable skill-only packages. Packages that introduce MCP servers remain disabled until an operator reviews them.
<<<
