STATUS: Active
TITLE: Handle-bound file context
STATEMENT: >>>
Workspace file listing and attachment reads remain confined while paths change. Content is read from the same authorized regular file handle.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: File
  VALUE: crates/infrastructure/src/files.rs

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: HARNESS-SECURITY-5
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Private existing API tokens
STATEMENT: >>>
Before reading an existing token, the host and desktop client verify the opened regular file. Unix requires the effective owner and no group or other permissions. Windows requires a private file ACL. New tokens are private before the first credential bytes are written.
<<<
